# Allowlist, not a blocklist.
#
# This repo is public (GitHub Pages needs it on the free plan), so nothing gets
# committed unless it is explicitly permitted here. Ignore everything, then
# re-admit the files that actually produce the website, one at a time.
#
# Consequence: CLAUDE.md, NOTES.local.md, screenshots, scratch PDFs, and
# anything else dropped into this directory are untracked by default.
#
# To add a genuinely new site file, add a matching "!" line below. If a file
# isn't listed, that is the intended behavior — don't work around it with
# `git add -f`.

# Ignore everything...
*

# ...but descend into directories, so the exceptions below can match.
!*/

# Pages
!index.html
!research.html
!teaching.html
!cv.html
!ai-in-university-education-interview/index.html

# Styles and hosting config
!style.css
!CNAME
!README.md
!.gitignore

# Assets (named explicitly — a PDF dropped into assets/ should not auto-commit)
!assets/ms_cv.pdf
!assets/shaffer_fin_accounting_text.pdf
